        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1367125687,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "It is sometimes planted as an ornamental plant in Singapore.\nIt can be grown in poor to well drained soils and is mostly disease and pest resistant.\nAlso specimens of the plant can be found in Cibodas Botanical Garden in West Java of Indonesia, and in the Fernarium of Univerisiti Kebangsaan in Malaysia",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
